    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/3003a3ea6343cb331b9abc67bc8a60a9195f16c7/0_0_2500_2500/1000.jpg?width=328&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/2c6d3cb4137b15b328ab66bd8083ae547089e9cc/0_183_1192_1191/master/1192.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none",
      "alt": "Hunter candles ",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I first discovered Hunter Candles when a colleague introduced me to their tucked-away storefront in Sydney’s tree-lined Surry Hills neighborhood. Their scents are fresh and never overpowering, with unique, earthy notes inspired by ingredients such as shiitake mushroom, river mint, blue gum trees, mountain ash and grapefruit rind (who would have thought!). I also love that customers in Australia can return empty candle glasses for refills. My favorite is Daisy , a bright scent with delicate florals and summery hints of peach. Maya Yang",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Daisy",
          "url": "https://go.skimresources.com/?id=114047X1771840&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theiconic.com.au%2Fjessica-candle-1279143.html&sref=https://www.theguardian.com/thefilter-us/2026/nov/11/best-international-gifts&xcust=abTestParticipations%7Cfronts-and-curation-editorial-test%3Ab"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/3003a3ea6343cb331b9abc67bc8a60a9195f16c7/0_0_2500_2500/1000.jpg?width=328&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Soft sheets from Dazed but Amazed"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/c9e15807fdd36099c130256fdaa584888433c86f/0_0_2500_2500/1000.jpg?width=328&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none",
      "alt": "",
      "caption": "",
