      "alt": "Rock & Ruby socks",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This sustainable knitwear brand, founded in east London during the pandemic, produces a beautiful array of striking, vintage-inspired socks. There are bold checks and tasteful stripes in a wide array of colors. I craved a pair as soon as I saw them. LB",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "bold checks",
          "url": "https://go.skimresources.com/?id=114047X1771840&url=https%3A%2F%2Fshop.com%2Fproducts%2F14851549004161%2Fhunter-green-edith-checked-cotton-socks%3FvariantId%3D53685288206721&sref=https://www.theguardian.com/thefilter-us/2026/nov/11/best-international-gifts&xcust=abTestParticipations%7Cfronts-and-curation-editorial-test%3Ab"
