      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/5618b824594c312875c6a0cab6b22da4eb8665a6/0_0_1262_1262/master/1262.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none",
      "alt": "El Dorado Rum",
      "caption": "",
      "credit": "The Guardian · Culture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "El Dorado rum comes from Guyana, where I’m originally from. Growing up, El Dorado was always a name we knew and took pride in. Guyana is known for its demerara sugar, and El Dorado rum is one of the great products that comes from the ingredient. When I give it as a gift, I love that I’m sharing a little piece of home and introducing someone to something special that represents my country. It’s a great rum. Keisa Caesar",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "El Dorado rum",
          "url": "https://go.skimresources.com/?id=114047X1771840&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.totalwine.com%2Fspirits%2Frum%2Faged-rum%2Fel-dorado-12-yo-guyana%2Fp%2F19276750&sref=https://www.theguardian.com/thefilter-us/2026/nov/11/best-international-gifts&xcust=abTestParticipations%7Cfronts-and-curation-editorial-test%3Ab"
        }
